{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Baby Photo-Challenge 是一款專為新手父母設計的嬰兒攝影挑戰應用，涵蓋從出生至三歲共 306 個創意主題。此 App 現正限時免費下載，原價為 US $0.99，幫助家長輕鬆捕捉並整理孩子成長過程中的珍貴時刻。</p>\n\n<h2>生成個人化相冊</h2>\n<p>完成拍攝挑戰後，用戶可將照片匯出為 PDF 格式的個人相冊。App 提供四種不同設計樣式供選擇，並支援自定義每個挑戰項目及靈活插入圖片。這些成品既可數碼分享予親友，亦適合列印保存，讓第一微笑、蹣跚學步等美好回憶得以永恆留存，成為家庭專屬的紀念品。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-134-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-135-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-136-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-137-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-138-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-139-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Baby Photo-Challenge</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T20:17:53.620343+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}